Woh Din Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Chhichhore sung by Arijit Singh. Best song for your school, college and hostel days memories.

Strumming Pattern: DD UDUDU or D D DU DU UDU UDU

{c: Intro} [C] [F] [G] [C]

